#
# Soil-seed Vtable for the FrankenNAM tm06 cycle: the Noah land state read from a grid-218
# NAM-format GRIB2 file valid at the model start (hindcast: the archived nam.tPPz.awphys00;
# live: FrankenNAM's own previous product valid at that time). Rows are copied from
# parm/nam_Vtable.NAM so the metgrid names match the GFS source (nam_Vtable.GFS.bocos) and
# NPS metgrid merges them field by field (see docs/tm06-design.md, "metgrid precedence").
# Not here on purpose: SEAICE and SST (stay GFS), SOILHGT/PSFC/PMSL and all 3-D fields.
# SKINTEMP is blanked over water by run/recast.sh (seed_prep) so the GFS SST survives.
